!packages/build/

# --- Tests ---
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# --- Tools & Analyzers ---
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user
*.dotCover
*.sln.DotSettings.user
.StyleCop.Cache
